# Only what the image build reads: the Cargo workspace (every member's
# manifest must be present) and the web UI. Anything else here would only
# invalidate the build cache.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/
!bindings/
!web/
bindings/wasm/pkg
bindings/wasm/node_modules
bindings/python/tests
web/pkg
**/target
